  role: Family neighbour
  greeting: It is good to see you back in the village. You have arrived before dark.
  weddingAnswer: Your cousin's wedding has brought everyone together. I have known
    the family for years.
  helpAnswer: The forest gets very dark after sunset. Keep your flashlight close,
    and follow the road when you return.
